      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of chronic knee pain of rare etiology is reported. Conventional radiographs excluded any articular pathology but ultrasound images showed features typical of a transsonic type tumor. Pathologic examination was necessary to establish the diagnosis, the tumor being an Antoni type A schwannoma."},
